- jobTitle: current job title, as the person or the employer states it.
- employer: name of the current employer. When the person has moved to another company, give the new one.
- location: city, state and country where the person works. Use the full English country name, for example "United States".
- summary: two or three sentences on the person's professional background: current role, areas of expertise and notable achievements.
